OL,3,GNEWSAGerrard unveils plans for new
OL,4,Asports facilities
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Premier League footballer Steven
OL,7,FGerrard has unveiled a
OL,8,Fmulti-million-pound investment in a
OL,9,Fpadel academy and new 3G football
OL,10,Fpitches.
OL,12,FThe ex-England midfielder said the
OL,13,Fsports and educational hubs would be
OL,14,Fbuilt in Liverpool and Knowsley.
OL,16,FThe former Liverpool captain, who grew
OL,17,Fup on the Bluebell estate in Huyton,
OL,18,Fsaid: "I've always wanted to give
OL,19,Fsomething back to the city where I was
OL,20,Fborn and the place I am proud to call
OL,21,Fhome."
